### Get all tickets from MongoDB
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### Get one ticket by ID 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/6a641439cceaa7a7cdbaf179

### Get a missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000

### Filter tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN

### Filter tickets by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?category=Email

### Filter tickets by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH

### Paged - first page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5

### Paged - second page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=5

### Get paged tickets with sorted by CreatedAt in descending order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc

### Create a valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop screen flickering and turning black",
  "description": "Laptop screen started flickering and occasionally goes completely black for 5 to 10 seconds at a time",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "High",
  "createdBy": "sarah@company.com"
}

### Create an invalid ticket -> expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}